  {"clause_id": "c020", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The second sentence is syntactically muddled: \"if the parties do not reach such agreement or if neither party gives notice ... as provided above earlier than thirty (30) days prior to the date of initial release\" leaves it unclear whether the thirty-day qualifier attaches to the notice or to the deemed date. The deemed delivery date therefore cannot be computed with confidence.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.29},
