  {"clause_id": "c021", "issues": [
    {"issue": "Masters are declared \"work made for hire\" and, in the alternative, assigned; whether a recording by an independent Grantor can qualify as a work made for hire is a recurring point of construction. The belt-and-braces drafting invites a dispute over which characterisation controls.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.22},
    {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.10}
